  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the woman as the subject of the accusation",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the woman in the image, who is the subject of the accusation implied by the text 'i told on you, she's pissed.' The user sees themselves as the one who 'told on' the woman, and thus identifies with the role of the accuser. The projection is onto the visual material of the woman, who is the target of the accusation. The text 'i told on you' directly addresses the user, making the user the implied subject of the action, and the woman the object. The user is projecting their own perspective onto the woman, imagining her as the 'pissed' entity being referenced.",
